{"4338180":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dearbnb","steam_appid":4338180,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dearbnb<\/strong> is a cozy management game where you build a real estate empire one room at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey by renting a small apartment in a modest neighborhood. Carefully decorate rooms, place furniture freely, set prices, and welcome tenants and customers. As you gain experience and reputation, unlock new zones — from poor districts to luxury neighborhoods and expand into residences, shops, and massive commercial properties.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room matters.<br>Every decision shapes your path to becoming a true property tycoon.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy, Decorate &amp; Rent<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, houses, residences, and commercial properties.<br>Place furniture freely in dedicated room scenes.No construction stress, just cozy design.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interior Customization &amp; Cozy Design<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every room exactly the way you want. <br>Change <strong>wall colors<\/strong>, <strong>floor materials<\/strong>, and freely place <strong>furniture and decorative items<\/strong> to shape the atmosphere of each space. <br>Every design choice affects comfort, property value, and customer satisfaction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create warm, minimal, luxury, or playful interiors your style defines your success.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Room-Based Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on a room to enter a focused decorating scene.<br>When your setup is complete, hit <strong>“Ready”<\/strong> and watch tenants and customers arrive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zone Progression<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in lower income districts and work your way up to elite neighborhoods.<br>Higher zones require experience, skills, and special badges to unlock.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Tree &amp; Badge System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new regions, property types, and business opportunities through progression and achievements.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Apartments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage cafes, shops, theme park, supermarket, cinema, aquapark and more. <br>Expand businesses, increase capacity, and optimize income streams.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Characters<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch tenants shower, relax, work, and interact with your spaces sometimes in surprising and funny ways.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Yet Strategic<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no combat.<br>A relaxing atmosphere combined with meaningful management decisions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dearbnb<\/strong> is a cozy management game where you build a real estate empire one room at a time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey by renting a small apartment in a modest neighborhood. Carefully decorate rooms, place furniture freely, set prices, and welcome tenants and customers. As you gain experience and reputation, unlock new zones — from poor districts to luxury neighborhoods and expand into residences, shops, and massive commercial properties.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room matters.<br>Every decision shapes your path to becoming a true property tycoon.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy, Decorate &amp; Rent<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, houses, residences, and commercial properties.<br>Place furniture freely in dedicated room scenes.No construction stress, just cozy design.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/5ec94b2ca4c31f9227f9506ef18faaea.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interior Customization &amp; Cozy Design<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every room exactly the way you want. <br>Change <strong>wall colors<\/strong>, <strong>floor materials<\/strong>, and freely place <strong>furniture and decorative items<\/strong> to shape the atmosphere of each space. <br>Every design choice affects comfort, property value, and customer satisfaction.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create warm, minimal, luxury, or playful interiors your style defines your success.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/c1120a28c376f0e2d06dadebcb674fcb.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Room-Based Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on a room to enter a focused decorating scene.<br>When your setup is complete, hit <strong>“Ready”<\/strong> and watch tenants and customers arrive.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zone Progression<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in lower income districts and work your way up to elite neighborhoods.<br>Higher zones require experience, skills, and special badges to unlock.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Tree &amp; Badge System<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new regions, property types, and business opportunities through progression and achievements.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beyond Apartments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage cafes, shops, theme park, supermarket, cinema, aquapark and more. <br>Expand businesses, increase capacity, and optimize income streams.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/e0264742ab9dd1cefeb7d243a69390c7.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lively Characters<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch tenants shower, relax, work, and interact with your spaces sometimes in surprising and funny ways.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Yet Strategic<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure, no combat.<br>A relaxing atmosphere combined with meaningful management decisions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.poster.avif?t=1793260712\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.webm?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/extras\/215ed0dc21a229067aca99392e022411.mp4?t=1793260712\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Buy, Decorate, Rent, Relax. Start with a tiny apartment, decorate cozy spaces, manage rentals and businesses, and rise from a poor neighborhood to the city’s most prestigious zones. A calming yet deep management experience where every room tells a story.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Hungarian, Romanian, Thai, Vietnamese, Czech","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/6e803c75fadd3dfed032291e1b3ab3c6e88afb52\/header.jpg?t=1793260712","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/58d67db8afd30eff275c501cd66b62a50c9d8f87\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793260712","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/58d67db8afd30eff275c501cd66b62a50c9d8f87\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793260712","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Gameshaft Studio"],"publishers":["GrabTheGames","Gamersky Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":799,"final":559,"discount_percent":30,"initial_formatted":"$7.99","final_formatted":"$5.59"},"packages":[1516431],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Dearbnb","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1516431,"percent_savings_text":"-30% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Dearbnb - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$7.99<\/span> $5.59","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":559}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/4e0b069a8a5f4db7924afb631311fdec247e962f\/ss_4e0b069a8a5f4db7924afb631311fdec247e962f.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/4e0b069a8a5f4db7924afb631311fdec247e962f\/ss_4e0b069a8a5f4db7924afb631311fdec247e962f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/14c90d0a41a2af55073bb78483cc3d9db3adb70e\/ss_14c90d0a41a2af55073bb78483cc3d9db3adb70e.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/14c90d0a41a2af55073bb78483cc3d9db3adb70e\/ss_14c90d0a41a2af55073bb78483cc3d9db3adb70e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/ee5bbd018daebccd9f752e6f0eafa349abd51fef\/ss_ee5bbd018daebccd9f752e6f0eafa349abd51fef.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/ee5bbd018daebccd9f752e6f0eafa349abd51fef\/ss_ee5bbd018daebccd9f752e6f0eafa349abd51fef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/35f3d1232ad2dcfd95405223b54806f0c0f7c417\/ss_35f3d1232ad2dcfd95405223b54806f0c0f7c417.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/35f3d1232ad2dcfd95405223b54806f0c0f7c417\/ss_35f3d1232ad2dcfd95405223b54806f0c0f7c417.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/2ae736cb6d654a7b7be4897c9bb5b749e77f796a\/ss_2ae736cb6d654a7b7be4897c9bb5b749e77f796a.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/2ae736cb6d654a7b7be4897c9bb5b749e77f796a\/ss_2ae736cb6d654a7b7be4897c9bb5b749e77f796a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/b58d570a68a97ff76e341a8ecc09f9116f83f325\/ss_b58d570a68a97ff76e341a8ecc09f9116f83f325.600x338.jpg?t=1793260712","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/b58d570a68a97ff76e341a8ecc09f9116f83f325\/ss_b58d570a68a97ff76e341a8ecc09f9116f83f325.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793260712"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4338180\/6aec6a5831720147add289bc4d48ac21aef7e3c